# Title: Add Windows Capability Via PowerShell Cmdlet
# ID: b36d01a3-ddaf-4804-be18-18a6247adfcd
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-01-22
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects usage of the "Add-WindowsCapability" cmdlet to add Windows capabilities. Notable capabilities could be "OpenSSH" and others.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*OpenSSH.*) AND (process.command_line:*Add-WindowsCapability*) AND (((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"pwsh.dll"))))
